{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">在無綫節目《在家宴客60道菜》中，邵德龍師傅為大家帶來了一道極具層次感的精緻佳餚——「烏魚子蝦仁蜜豆燜蛋」。這道菜式不僅擁有如梳乎厘般鬆軟綿滑的質感，再配搭上自帶獨特鹹鮮味的烏魚子，惹味非常，絕對是宴客時的驚喜之選！</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"f9fa7e43-5a9d-4373-b29c-518d45ec58c2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026S7QhZw7zID1791428734.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"f9fa7e43-5a9d-4373-b29c-518d45ec58c2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left\"></h3><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"84a37f5e-ec09-48c7-a1a4-1ee39a14aed2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026SJS9EApoxM1791428733.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"84a37f5e-ec09-48c7-a1a4-1ee39a14aed2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>4大零